  TutorialTasks:
  - Step: 8
    Text: "Enemies come in through the GATE. \nDefeat them and protect your CORE."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Welcome!
    Focus: 0201
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "This is ORE. A belt laid on ore mines shapes from it. \nShapes are your
      money and your ammo."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: 4, y: 11}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 00
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Ore
    Focus: 03
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "Every building costs ore shapes. This is how many you have. \nMine ore
      to get more!"
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Building costs
    Focus: 06
    Reveal: 2
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: 'The buildings you can use appear down here.

      The number on the bottom
      right is how much ore it costs.'
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Build bar
    Focus: 0c
    Reveal: 4
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 10
    Text: Press 1, or click the BELT.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Pick the belt
    Focus: 05
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 1
    Text: Press on the glowing ORE tile, and drag down into the Core.
    Hint: Start the drag on the ore itself, then let go on the Core.
    Target: {x: 4, y: 11}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 11}
      Facing: 2
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 10}
      Facing: 2
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 4, y: 9}
      Facing: 2
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Lay the belt
    Focus: 0401
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: Your first shape reached the Core! This number goes up with every shape
      you bank.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 09
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Success!
    Focus: 06
    Reveal: 2
    AddsOre:
    - Cell: {x: 9, y: 2}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 10, y: 2}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 9, y: 3}
      Mineral: 1
    - Cell: {x: 10, y: 3}
      Mineral: 1
  - Step: 8
    Text: "Placed something in the wrong spot? \nRIGHT-CLICK it to delete it."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Mistakes are fine
    Focus: 
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 11
    Text: "Turrets shoot enemies. \nPress 0, or click the TURRET."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Pick the turret
    Focus: 05
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 12
    Text: Click the glowing tile next to the enemies' road to place the turret.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: 12, y: 3}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 9
      Cell: {x: 12, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Place the turret
    Focus: 04
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 2
    Text: "Turrets fire the shapes you feed them. \nDrag a belt from the new ORE
      into the turret."
    Hint: Press 1, start on the glowing ore tile, and drag right until you reach
      the turret.
    Target: {x: 10, y: 3}
    Ghost:
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 10, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    - Build: 0
      Cell: {x: 11, y: 3}
      Facing: 1
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Load the turret
    Focus: 0405
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "The turret has ammo. \nNow let's move to the top of the screen."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Loaded!
    Focus: 0b
    Reveal: 1
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "Your Core's health. \nIf it reaches zero, you lose."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Core health
    Focus: 07
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "Which wave is next, and when it comes. \nClear every wave to win."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Waves
    Focus: 08
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 8
    Text: "The shape these enemies are weak to. \nThis wave: a full circle, which
      your ore gives."
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Weakness
    Focus: 09
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 13
    Text: Press N, or click this button, to start wave 1.
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 1
    Title: Ready?
    Focus: 0a02
    Reveal: 8
    AddsOre: []
  - Step: 14
    Text: Here they come. Watch your turret fire!
    Hint: 
    Target: {x: -1, y: -1}
    Ghost: []
    Opens: 
    StartsWave: 0
    Title: Defend!
    Focus: 01
    Reveal: 0
    AddsOre: []
